<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ARPS Motorsport | Sponsorship & Media</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08), transparent 35%), #080f24;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .topbar {
            padding: 22px 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            background: rgba(8,15,36,0.95);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .brand {
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #00f0ff;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .back-btn {
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .back-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 45px 30px 60px;
        }
        .header-card {
            padding: 35px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.15);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(19,30,58,0.96), rgba(10,18,40,0.96));
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
        }
        .tag {
            color: #00f0ff;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        h1 { margin: 12px 0 10px; font-size: 36px; }
        p { color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 750px; }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .card {
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            background: #131e3a;
        }
        .card h3 { color: #00f0ff; margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">ARPS MOTORSPORT</div>
    <a class="back-btn" href="../index.html">← Back to Hub</a>
</header>

<main class="container">
    <section class="header-card">
        <div class="tag">Section 03</div>
        <h1>Sponsorship & Media</h1>
        <p>Partner management, commercial proposals, social media strategy, branding assets, and media reach tracking.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Partner Deck & Pitching</h3>
            <p>Sponsorship proposals, partner benefits, media kit, and commercial pitch presentations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Media & Content</h3>
            <p>Photography, video assets, social media output, livery concepts, and press releases.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Partner Management</h3>
            <p>Deliverables tracking, sponsor updates, race weekend branding, and engagement reporting.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
